 "transcript_start": "I heard someone say the other day, if you want to go fast, go alone, but if you want to go far, go together. And this week, I saw the biggest proof of it. A brother and a sister just took their company public at one and a half trillion dollars. Dario and Daniela Amodei are the founders of Anthropic, the company behind Claude. These are two people who grew up in the exact same house, and who in Daniela's words both felt this immense responsibility",
